  "source_title": "中国大地上，哪座名山才是老天爷亲手垒起的终极天花板？泰山五岳独尊，黄山奇松云海，名气压了五百年，却都可能被它压住气场。它身上压着五千年香火，不是山，是中国人的根#中国名山 #中国地理#旅行#景点",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_437a713b9e8f4623_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 367.432993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道，中国大地上老天爷亲手垒起来的最不可思议的名山究竟藏在哪一个角落吗？有人说是山东泰山五岳独尊皇帝都去封禅。有人说是安徽黄山奇松怪石云海、温泉名，气压了五百年。可您要是真信了，那就被忽悠了。真正霸榜的那个一露脸，他们都得往后站。他被公认为中国名山名山的终极天花板，身上压着五千年的香火。这座山不是山，是中国人的根。今天咱们就来盘点盘点中国十大名山，可能您去过不少名山大川，可这种立在地球上几千万年的东西，看一回少一回。老规矩，开讲之前，劳烦您顺手扣个一点颗红心，让我看看都是谁在听第十名。山西衡山在山西大同浑源县五月里的北岳，这山最绝的是他像一条龙东西绵延五百多公里，一百零八座山峰像一百零八颗、龙牙、恒山的主峰天峰岭，海拔两千零一十六米，自古就是兵家必争之地，倒马关、紫金关，平行关全在衡山山脉上。北宋年间，杨家将就在衡山一带镇守边关留下多少忠烈的故事。悬空寺就挂在衡山脚下的金龙峡，一千五百年了不塌不歪，您说这是山还是北方的屏障？第九名，湖南衡山在湖南衡阳五月里的南月，这山最绝的是它满山都是树，森林覆盖率超过百分之九十，古树名木一千三百多种，红豆杉、银杏、摇钱树泉有衡山，还有个外号叫受阅。南岳衡山。寿比南山说的就是这座山。从汉代开始，历代皇帝都来衡山祭祀，一年四季，春天看花，夏天避暑，秋天看日出，冬天看雪。东天横山顶上悟感挂满树枝，跟冰雕一样，山下是绿的，山上是白的，您说这是山还是四季的舞台？第八名，河南嵩山在河南登封五月里的中月。这山最绝的是他脚底下踩着两个中国第一，中国第一座天门台登峰观星台郭守敬在这儿测出了授时力，一年三百六十五点二四二五天，跟现在功力几乎一样，比欧洲早了整整三百年。中国第一座官办寺院白马寺就在嵩山脚下。佛教传入中国以后，官方建的第一座寺院，一座山踩着一个天门第一，一个佛教第一，少林寺也在嵩山达摩面壁九年创了禅宗，您说这是山还是中原文脉的根？第七名？吉林长白山在吉林延边中国最深的火珊瑚天池就在他头顶上最深处三百七十三米，水面海拔两千一百八十九米。这山最绝的是他藏在天上四周，十六座山峰围着向十六个卫士，把一池水端在半空中，天池的水只出不进，没有河流注入，全靠雨水和地下水。可水位几百年不变更邪乎的是天池，一年有三分之二的时间，云雾笼罩，很多人去了好几次，连湖面都没见着，能看见天池全貌的人，当地人说，那是有缘分，您说这是山还是老天爷搁在山顶上的一碗水？第六名，江西庐山在江西九江这山最绝的不是是诗。庐山有多少诗？据统计，三千五百多位名人写下了一万六千多首诗歌。咏唱庐山，李白来过五次，写了四十多篇一首望庐山瀑布飞流直下三千尺，疑是银河落九天。苏轼来了，写了一句不识庐山真面目，只缘身在此山中，白居易来了，写人间四月芳菲尽，山寺桃花始盛开，陶渊明住在山脚下，采菊东篱下，悠然见南山。一座座山把中国最好的诗人全招来了，您说这是山还是一本诗集？从第十到第六，衡山是北方的屏障，衡山是四季的舞台，嵩山是中原文脉的根，长白山是老天爷的一碗水，庐山是一本诗集，可这五个还不是最震撼的。接下来第五道第一，一个比一个狠，有一座山，自古华山一条路，有一座山，金顶佛光，还有一座山，被叫做万山之祖。它凭什么排第一？下集马上更新，您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 790,
      "text": "您知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00002",
      "start_ms": 790,
      "end_ms": 8590,
      "text": "中国大地上老天爷亲手垒起来的最不可思议的名山究竟藏在哪一个角落吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00003",
      "start_ms": 9070,
      "end_ms": 14410,
      "text": "有人说是山东泰山五岳独尊皇帝都去封禅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00004",
      "start_ms": 14890,
      "end_ms": 19190,
      "text": "有人说是安徽黄山奇松怪石云海、温泉名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00005",
      "start_ms": 19190,
      "end_ms": 20330,
      "text": "气压了五百年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00006",
      "start_ms": 20690,
      "end_ms": 22010,
      "text": "可您要是真信了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00007",
      "start_ms": 22190,
      "end_ms": 23310,
      "text": "那就被忽悠了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00008",
      "start_ms": 23690,
      "end_ms": 26190,
      "text": "真正霸榜的那个一露脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00009",
      "start_ms": 26190,
      "end_ms": 27210,
      "text": "他们都得往后站。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00010",
      "start_ms": 27690,
      "end_ms": 31840,
      "text": "他被公认为中国名山名山的终极天花板，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00011",
      "start_ms": 32080,
      "end_ms": 34480,
      "text": "身上压着五千年的香火。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00012",
      "start_ms": 35740,
      "end_ms": 37240,
      "text": "这座山不是山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00013",
      "start_ms": 37660,
      "end_ms": 38900,
      "text": "是中国人的根。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00014",
      "start_ms": 39800,
      "end_ms": 44660,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点盘点中国十大名山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00015",
      "start_ms": 45540,
      "end_ms": 47940,
      "text": "可能您去过不少名山大川，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00016",
      "start_ms": 48420,
      "end_ms": 52020,
      "text": "可这种立在地球上几千万年的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00017",
      "start_ms": 52440,
      "end_ms": 53620,
      "text": "看一回少一回。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00018",
      "start_ms": 54520,
      "end_ms": 55180,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00019",
      "start_ms": 55620,
      "end_ms": 56440,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00020",
      "start_ms": 56440,
      "end_ms": 59765,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手扣个一点颗红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00021",
      "start_ms": 60130,
      "end_ms": 63595,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00022",
      "start_ms": 63950,
      "end_ms": 69795,
      "text": "山西衡山在山西大同浑源县五月里的北岳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00023",
      "start_ms": 70540,
      "end_ms": 76365,
      "text": "这山最绝的是他像一条龙东西绵延五百多公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00024",
      "start_ms": 76890,
      "end_ms": 82975,
      "text": "一百零八座山峰像一百零八颗、龙牙、恒山的主峰天峰岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00025",
      "start_ms": 83340,
      "end_ms": 85055,
      "text": "海拔两千零一十六米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00026",
      "start_ms": 85580,
      "end_ms": 87945,
      "text": "自古就是兵家必争之地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00027",
      "start_ms": 88280,
      "end_ms": 89720,
      "text": "倒马关、紫金关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00028",
      "start_ms": 89840,
      "end_ms": 92865,
      "text": "平行关全在衡山山脉上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00029",
      "start_ms": 93330,
      "end_ms": 94155,
      "text": "北宋年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00030",
      "start_ms": 94580,
      "end_ms": 100205,
      "text": "杨家将就在衡山一带镇守边关留下多少忠烈的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00031",
      "start_ms": 101030,
      "end_ms": 105135,
      "text": "悬空寺就挂在衡山脚下的金龙峡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00032",
      "start_ms": 105560,
      "end_ms": 107845,
      "text": "一千五百年了不塌不歪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00033",
      "start_ms": 108360,
      "end_ms": 111125,
      "text": "您说这是山还是北方的屏障？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00034",
      "start_ms": 111720,
      "end_ms": 112385,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00035",
      "start_ms": 112710,
      "end_ms": 117005,
      "text": "湖南衡山在湖南衡阳五月里的南月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00036",
      "start_ms": 117270,
      "end_ms": 120205,
      "text": "这山最绝的是它满山都是树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00037",
      "start_ms": 120910,
      "end_ms": 123365,
      "text": "森林覆盖率超过百分之九十，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00038",
      "start_ms": 124380,
      "end_ms": 127155,
      "text": "古树名木一千三百多种，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00039",
      "start_ms": 128170,
      "end_ms": 133490,
      "text": "红豆杉、银杏、摇钱树泉有衡山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00040",
      "start_ms": 133570,
      "end_ms": 135925,
      "text": "还有个外号叫受阅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00041",
      "start_ms": 136260,
      "end_ms": 137265,
      "text": "南岳衡山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00042",
      "start_ms": 137640,
      "end_ms": 140275,
      "text": "寿比南山说的就是这座山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00043",
      "start_ms": 141150,
      "end_ms": 142395,
      "text": "从汉代开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00044",
      "start_ms": 142800,
      "end_ms": 145385,
      "text": "历代皇帝都来衡山祭祀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00045",
      "start_ms": 146190,
      "end_ms": 147145,
      "text": "一年四季，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00046",
      "start_ms": 147460,
      "end_ms": 148520,
      "text": "春天看花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00047",
      "start_ms": 148900,
      "end_ms": 150000,
      "text": "夏天避暑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00048",
      "start_ms": 150300,
      "end_ms": 151625,
      "text": "秋天看日出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00049",
      "start_ms": 152240,
      "end_ms": 153155,
      "text": "冬天看雪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00050",
      "start_ms": 153450,
      "end_ms": 156690,
      "text": "东天横山顶上悟感挂满树枝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00051",
      "start_ms": 156890,
      "end_ms": 158025,
      "text": "跟冰雕一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00052",
      "start_ms": 158410,
      "end_ms": 159375,
      "text": "山下是绿的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00053",
      "start_ms": 159570,
      "end_ms": 160695,
      "text": "山上是白的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00054",
      "start_ms": 161040,
      "end_ms": 164155,
      "text": "您说这是山还是四季的舞台？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00055",
      "start_ms": 164670,
      "end_ms": 165410,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00056",
      "start_ms": 165690,
      "end_ms": 169805,
      "text": "河南嵩山在河南登封五月里的中月。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00057",
      "start_ms": 170210,
      "end_ms": 174205,
      "text": "这山最绝的是他脚底下踩着两个中国第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00058",
      "start_ms": 174850,
      "end_ms": 181605,
      "text": "中国第一座天门台登峰观星台郭守敬在这儿测出了授时力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00059",
      "start_ms": 182040,
      "end_ms": 185475,
      "text": "一年三百六十五点二四二五天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00060",
      "start_ms": 186210,
      "end_ms": 188175,
      "text": "跟现在功力几乎一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00061",
      "start_ms": 189110,
      "end_ms": 191775,
      "text": "比欧洲早了整整三百年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00062",
      "start_ms": 192260,
      "end_ms": 198465,
      "text": "中国第一座官办寺院白马寺就在嵩山脚下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00063",
      "start_ms": 199370,
      "end_ms": 201110,
      "text": "佛教传入中国以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00064",
      "start_ms": 201310,
      "end_ms": 203375,
      "text": "官方建的第一座寺院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00065",
      "start_ms": 203750,
      "end_ms": 207105,
      "text": "一座山踩着一个天门第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00066",
      "start_ms": 207430,
      "end_ms": 208605,
      "text": "一个佛教第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00067",
      "start_ms": 209440,
      "end_ms": 215325,
      "text": "少林寺也在嵩山达摩面壁九年创了禅宗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00068",
      "start_ms": 215580,
      "end_ms": 219005,
      "text": "您说这是山还是中原文脉的根？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00069",
      "start_ms": 219890,
      "end_ms": 220585,
      "text": "第七名？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00070",
      "start_ms": 220960,
      "end_ms": 231725,
      "text": "吉林长白山在吉林延边中国最深的火珊瑚天池就在他头顶上最深处三百七十三米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00071",
      "start_ms": 232280,
      "end_ms": 234785,
      "text": "水面海拔两千一百八十九米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00072",
      "start_ms": 235330,
      "end_ms": 239210,
      "text": "这山最绝的是他藏在天上四周，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00073",
      "start_ms": 239230,
      "end_ms": 242530,
      "text": "十六座山峰围着向十六个卫士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00074",
      "start_ms": 242670,
      "end_ms": 244855,
      "text": "把一池水端在半空中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00075",
      "start_ms": 245790,
      "end_ms": 247965,
      "text": "天池的水只出不进，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00076",
      "start_ms": 248580,
      "end_ms": 249875,
      "text": "没有河流注入，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00077",
      "start_ms": 250400,
      "end_ms": 252305,
      "text": "全靠雨水和地下水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00078",
      "start_ms": 253110,
      "end_ms": 257840,
      "text": "可水位几百年不变更邪乎的是天池，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00079",
      "start_ms": 257860,
      "end_ms": 259515,
      "text": "一年有三分之二的时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00080",
      "start_ms": 259910,
      "end_ms": 260825,
      "text": "云雾笼罩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00081",
      "start_ms": 261170,
      "end_ms": 262585,
      "text": "很多人去了好几次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00082",
      "start_ms": 262930,
      "end_ms": 264315,
      "text": "连湖面都没见着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00083",
      "start_ms": 264840,
      "end_ms": 266865,
      "text": "能看见天池全貌的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00084",
      "start_ms": 267430,
      "end_ms": 268210,
      "text": "当地人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00085",
      "start_ms": 268470,
      "end_ms": 269485,
      "text": "那是有缘分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00086",
      "start_ms": 269900,
      "end_ms": 273375,
      "text": "您说这是山还是老天爷搁在山顶上的一碗水？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00087",
      "start_ms": 273970,
      "end_ms": 274635,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00088",
      "start_ms": 275610,
      "end_ms": 282365,
      "text": "江西庐山在江西九江这山最绝的不是是诗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00089",
      "start_ms": 283230,
      "end_ms": 284675,
      "text": "庐山有多少诗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00090",
      "start_ms": 285530,
      "end_ms": 286270,
      "text": "据统计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00091",
      "start_ms": 286530,
      "end_ms": 291465,
      "text": "三千五百多位名人写下了一万六千多首诗歌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00092",
      "start_ms": 292210,
      "end_ms": 293210,
      "text": "咏唱庐山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00093",
      "start_ms": 294050,
      "end_ms": 295590,
      "text": "李白来过五次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00094",
      "start_ms": 296130,
      "end_ms": 301150,
      "text": "写了四十多篇一首望庐山瀑布飞流直下三千尺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00095",
      "start_ms": 301550,
      "end_ms": 303610,
      "text": "疑是银河落九天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00096",
      "start_ms": 304110,
      "end_ms": 305050,
      "text": "苏轼来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00097",
      "start_ms": 305210,
      "end_ms": 307250,
      "text": "写了一句不识庐山真面目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00098",
      "start_ms": 307690,
      "end_ms": 309470,
      "text": "只缘身在此山中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00099",
      "start_ms": 309650,
      "end_ms": 310550,
      "text": "白居易来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00100",
      "start_ms": 310850,
      "end_ms": 313130,
      "text": "写人间四月芳菲尽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00101",
      "start_ms": 313550,
      "end_ms": 315570,
      "text": "山寺桃花始盛开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00102",
      "start_ms": 316130,
      "end_ms": 317730,
      "text": "陶渊明住在山脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00103",
      "start_ms": 318210,
      "end_ms": 319590,
      "text": "采菊东篱下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00104",
      "start_ms": 319930,
      "end_ms": 321170,
      "text": "悠然见南山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00105",
      "start_ms": 321170,
      "end_ms": 325540,
      "text": "一座座山把中国最好的诗人全招来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00106",
      "start_ms": 326280,
      "end_ms": 329080,
      "text": "您说这是山还是一本诗集？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00107",
      "start_ms": 329900,
      "end_ms": 331280,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00108",
      "start_ms": 331580,
      "end_ms": 334040,
      "text": "衡山是北方的屏障，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00109",
      "start_ms": 334640,
      "end_ms": 336800,
      "text": "衡山是四季的舞台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00110",
      "start_ms": 337160,
      "end_ms": 339600,
      "text": "嵩山是中原文脉的根，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00111",
      "start_ms": 340320,
      "end_ms": 342600,
      "text": "长白山是老天爷的一碗水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00112",
      "start_ms": 342940,
      "end_ms": 344460,
      "text": "庐山是一本诗集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00113",
      "start_ms": 345200,
      "end_ms": 347920,
      "text": "可这五个还不是最震撼的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00114",
      "start_ms": 348740,
      "end_ms": 350140,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00115",
      "start_ms": 350320,
      "end_ms": 351545,
      "text": "一个比一个狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00116",
      "start_ms": 352080,
      "end_ms": 352975,
      "text": "有一座山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00117",
      "start_ms": 353480,
      "end_ms": 355095,
      "text": "自古华山一条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00118",
      "start_ms": 355470,
      "end_ms": 356315,
      "text": "有一座山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00119",
      "start_ms": 356660,
      "end_ms": 357675,
      "text": "金顶佛光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00120",
      "start_ms": 358120,
      "end_ms": 359040,
      "text": "还有一座山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00121",
      "start_ms": 359240,
      "end_ms": 361040,
      "text": "被叫做万山之祖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00122",
      "start_ms": 361180,
      "end_ms": 362545,
      "text": "它凭什么排第一？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00123",
      "start_ms": 362880,
      "end_ms": 364095,
      "text": "下集马上更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_437a713b9e8f4623_s00124",
      "start_ms": 364450,
      "end_ms": 367325,
      "text": "您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
